@prefix this: <http://purl.org/nanopub/temp/status_v2_20260603/> .
@prefix sub: <http://purl.org/nanopub/temp/status_v2_20260603/> .
@prefix np: <http://www.nanopub.org/nschema#> .
@prefix dct: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix nt: <https://w3id.org/np/o/ntemplate/> .
@prefix npx: <http://purl.org/nanopub/x/> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix orcid: <https://orcid.org/> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .

sub:Head {
  this: a np:Nanopublication ;
    np:hasAssertion sub:assertion ;
    np:hasProvenance sub:provenance ;
    np:hasPublicationInfo sub:pubinfo .
}

sub:assertion {
  sub:statusUpdate a <https://w3id.org/kpxl/gen/terms/StatusUpdate> ;
    rdfs:label "MAC FDT v2 catalogue cleanup pass — closed; FDT paper v1.0 consolidated; nanopub-skill addendum ready" ;
    dct:isPartOf <https://w3id.org/spaces/knowledgepixels/incubator/officehours/20260603> ;
    <http://schema.org/about> <https://w3id.org/spaces/mac/r/ontology/MAC-Ontology> ,
                              <https://w3id.org/spaces/knowledgepixels/incubator/project4> ;
    dct:description """v2 catalogue cleanup pass closed (PR #5, https://github.com/easchultes/mac-fdt-staging/pull/5). 48 nanopub operations on the live NSN across 5 commits:

- 3 upstream /-form v2 re-mints (StayAhead Project FDO, ESM Dataset FDO, AlphaFold Dataset FDO) supersede their v1 predecessors directly.
- 3 retractions of intermediate #-form upstream defectives. The nanopub-py 2.0.1 signing pipeline hard-codes # as the FDO referent separator; MAC catalogue convention is /. Defect worked around by switching the signer to nanopub-java 1.88.0. Implementation Guide §6 Appendix C.10 documents the pitfall.
- 38 Stage 3 v2 instance mints (3 Type 1 anchors + 5 method FDOs + 18 computational predictions + 12 final observations). Authoritative v1→v2 mapping at docs/v2-cleanup/supersession_registry.md.
- 4 Stage 4 v2 mints (Alpha knowlet view set), re-minted against the Alpha-RBD-Variant v2 referent.

SPARQL verification on query.knowledgepixels.com/repo/full: 38 + 4 npx:supersedes pairs, 38 dct:isPartOf to Project v2, 21 dct:source to Dataset v2 (12 ESM + 9 AF), 57 mac:* intra-Stage-3 cross-refs to Pass-1 v2 referents.

Three asymmetric Stage 4 URI-form conventions documented (gen:hasViewQuery bare-Trusty; gen:isDisplayOfView referent; pin-action no introduced referent). Honest commit history preserved on PR #5: the false-start #-form upstream mint remains visible as audit trail.

FDT paper v1.0 consolidated on sibling branch paper-v06-consolidation (HEAD 061eefb): §5 Trusty URI tables populated with v2 referents (38 substitutions HTTP GET-verified), §6.4 substrate-landscape calibration, §6.6 regulatory-salience paragraph (EU AI Act, model collapse), §6.7 three-paper companion sequence, §6.8 (new) catalogue refinement with Git-parallel architectural framing, 15 new references, target venue updated to Digital Twin (Taylor & Francis).

Tobias second-PR addendum draft (docs/tobias_skill_addendum.md) ready for the nanopub-skill repo: 4 operational findings (npx:retracts subject convention, registry content negotiation, SPARQL DISTINCT on /repo/full, publish-to-GET propagation lag), each with Origin: PROMPT traceability footers.

Workstreams unblocked: FDT paper v1.0 → Digital Twin (T&F); Tobias second PR → nanopub-skill; FDT pattern paper (3 domains); 45 Implementation Guide narrative refs deferred; external touchpoints (StayAhead report, MAC_FAIR_v2 manuscript, slides) catalogued in docs/v2-cleanup/downstream_doc_register.md.

Earlier status nanopub attempt (https://w3id.org/np/RAeNRMdW7E7NbJ8kYqvzcoetiGxLZTLELHH6gjHovPPI4) and its pin-action (https://w3id.org/np/RAHUY7A3Oak7NvXfvkgF7yw7ZUeLFp82mtVZz2iHKW0S0) used the wrong type (fabio:Statement) and pinning predicate (gen:hasPinnedQuery), so they didn't appear in the Status Updates view; this one uses the correct gen:StatusUpdate template (RAFpk14hjqsgCRi1kEwLq7F9BcRPoK1E8PrqhaZvxQuac).""" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/easchultes/mac-fdt-staging/pull/5> ,
                 <https://github.com/easchultes/mac-fdt-staging/tree/paper-v06-consolidation> .
}

sub:provenance {
  sub:assertion prov:wasAttributedTo orcid:0000-0001-8888-635X .
}

